WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
What else can I feed her?

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:06,040
It must be the father given by Lao Wang

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,040
I want to go out

4
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:17,960
When did you have a daughter?

5
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:20,160
It’s such a big red envelope.

6
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,360
I have to make up for this money

7
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:22,960
I only found out some time ago

8
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,960
My parents don’t know now

9
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:27,960
Don't let it slip when you're on the phone with your grandma.

10
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:29,660
Xu Qingyao and I have divorced

11
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:30,660
Don't talk nonsense about this either.

12
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:33,730
This is your Uncle Dashan

13
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:34,730
I'll be bored from now on

14
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:39,740
You can ask him to play Suzhuo

15
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:41,860
Now that the task has been released, please report it clearly.
